      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Spinal arachnoid cysts are a rare cause of spinal cord compression in children and presenting symptoms may be subtle. We present a neurologically intact 14-month-old boy who presented with pain and postural irritability from a thoracic arachnoid cyst."},
